  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Paraguary - Regional Plant Protection Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the 2014-16 Agreement between IICA and APHIS-IS for Plant and Animal Health capacity building, IICA with support from the regional NPPOs and in particular from the Paraguay NPPO. The objective of this activity is to review with plant health officials - key Phytosanitary principles that countries must focus on to protect domestic plant resources and to enable the trade of agricultural products.</narrative>
  </description>
